---
import Section from '../../layout/Section.astro';
---

<Section contained={false} spacing="none" class="overflow-hidden lg:pt-32 lg:pb-32 border-white/0 border-t pt-16 pb-16">


        <div class="font-manrope max-w-7xl mr-auto ml-auto pr-6 pl-6">
            <div class="lg:mb-20 text-center mb-16">
                <h2
                    class="md:text-4xl lg:text-5xl text-4xl font-normal text-white tracking-tight font-manrope max-w-4xl mr-auto mb-6 ml-auto"
                    data-translate="testimonials.title">
                    What businesses say</h2>
                <p data-garna-subtitle class="text-xl font-light text-gray-400 font-manrope max-w-3xl mx-auto" data-translate="testimonials.description">Real stories, real results.
                    See how our platform accelerates global hiring</p>
            </div>
            <div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-3 gap-8 gap-x-8 gap-y-8">
                <!-- Testimonial 1 -->
                <div
                    class="group relative bg-[#0A0A0A] hover:bg-[#0F0F0F] p-8 rounded-2xl border border-white/5 hover:border-white/10 transition-all duration-300 hover:-translate-y-1 overflow-hidden">
                    <div
                        class="absolute -right-4 -top-4 w-24 h-24 bg-[#CBF300]/5 rounded-full blur-2xl group-hover:bg-[#CBF300]/10 transition-colors duration-500">
                    </div>

                    <div class="relative z-10 flex flex-col h-full">
                        <div class="flex justify-between items-start mb-6">
                            <div class="flex gap-0.5 text-yellow-500">
                                <iconify-icon icon="solar:star-bold" width="14" class=""></iconify-icon>
                                <iconify-icon icon="solar:star-bold" width="14" class=""></iconify-icon>
                                <iconify-icon icon="solar:star-bold" width="14"></iconify-icon>
                                <iconify-icon icon="solar:star-bold" width="14" class=""></iconify-icon>
                                <iconify-icon icon="solar:star-bold" width="14" class=""></iconify-icon>
                            </div>
                            <iconify-icon icon="lucide:quote"
                                class="text-gray-700 group-hover:text-gray-600 transition-colors"
                                width="24" height="24"></iconify-icon>
                        </div>

                        <p class="leading-relaxed text-gray-300 mb-8" data-translate="testimonials.quote1">"I used to spend weeks on initial phone screens.
                            The AI did the heavy lifting for us. We only met with fully vetted candidates and made a key
                            technical hire within four days of posting."</p>

                        <div class="flex items-center gap-4 mt-auto border-t border-white/5 pt-6">
                            <img src="https://hoirqrkdgbmvpwutwuwj.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/assets/assets/1060dbfb-a41e-425e-b1bf-586c452a0275_320w.webp"
                                alt="Sofia Alvarez"
                                class="group-hover:ring-white/5 transition-all w-10 h-10 object-cover border-white/10 border ring-transparent ring-2 rounded-full"
                                data-translate-alt="testimonials.sofiaAlvarez">
                            <div class="">
                                <div class="text-sm font-normal text-white tracking-tight font-manrope" data-translate="testimonials.sofiaAlvarez">Sofia Alvarez
                                </div>
                                <div class="text-xs font-medium text-[#CBF300] font-manrope" data-translate="testimonials.vpHRFinScale">VP of HR, FinScale</div>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>

                <!-- Testimonial 2 -->
                <div
                    class="group relative bg-[#0A0A0A] hover:bg-[#0F0F0F] p-8 rounded-2xl border border-white/5 hover:border-white/10 transition-all duration-300 hover:-translate-y-1 overflow-hidden">
                    <div
                        class="absolute -right-4 -top-4 w-24 h-24 bg-[#CBF300]/5 rounded-full blur-2xl group-hover:bg-[#CBF300]/10 transition-colors duration-500">
                    </div>

                    <div class="relative z-10 flex flex-col h-full">
                        <div class="flex justify-between items-start mb-6">
                            <div class="flex gap-0.5 text-yellow-500">
                                <iconify-icon icon="solar:star-bold" width="14" class=""></iconify-icon>
                                <iconify-icon icon="solar:star-bold" width="14" class=""></iconify-icon>
                                <iconify-icon icon="solar:star-bold" width="14" class=""></iconify-icon>
                                <iconify-icon icon="solar:star-bold" width="14" class=""></iconify-icon>
                                <iconify-icon icon="solar:star-bold" width="14"></iconify-icon>
                            </div>
                            <iconify-icon icon="lucide:quote"
                                class="text-gray-700 group-hover:text-gray-600 transition-colors"
                                width="24" height="24"></iconify-icon>
                        </div>

                        <p class="leading-relaxed text-gray-300 mb-8" data-translate="testimonials.quote2">"Traditional agencies just spam us with resumes.
                            It felt like this system actually understood our requirements better than human recruiters.
                            The match rate for our open roles was incredibly precise."</p>

                        <div class="flex items-center gap-4 mt-auto border-t border-white/5 pt-6">
                            <img src="https://hoirqrkdgbmvpwutwuwj.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/assets/assets/25df7579-09f7-4c8c-bb39-18a974a980d0_320w.webp"
                                alt="Daniel Lee"
                                class="group-hover:ring-white/5 transition-all w-10 h-10 object-cover border-white/10 border ring-transparent ring-2 rounded-full"
                                data-translate-alt="testimonials.danielLee">
                            <div class="">
                                <div class="text-sm font-normal text-white tracking-tight font-manrope" data-translate="testimonials.danielLee">Daniel Lee</div>
                                <div class="text-xs font-medium text-[#CBF300] font-manrope" data-translate="testimonials.ctoNexusSolutions">CTO, Nexus Solutions</div>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>

                <!-- Testimonial 3 -->
                <div
                    class="group relative bg-[#0A0A0A] hover:bg-[#0F0F0F] p-8 rounded-2xl border border-white/5 hover:border-white/10 transition-all duration-300 hover:-translate-y-1 overflow-hidden">
                    <div
                        class="absolute -right-4 -top-4 w-24 h-24 bg-[#CBF300]/5 rounded-full blur-2xl group-hover:bg-[#CBF300]/10 transition-colors duration-500">
                    </div>

                    <div class="relative z-10 flex flex-col h-full">
                        <div class="flex justify-between items-start mb-6">
                            <div class="flex gap-0.5 text-yellow-500">
                                <iconify-icon icon="solar:star-bold" width="14"></iconify-icon>
                                <iconify-icon icon="solar:star-bold" width="14"></iconify-icon>
                                <iconify-icon icon="solar:star-bold" width="14" class=""></iconify-icon>
                                <iconify-icon icon="solar:star-bold" width="14" class=""></iconify-icon>
                                <iconify-icon icon="solar:star-bold" width="14"></iconify-icon>
                            </div>
                            <iconify-icon icon="lucide:quote"
                                class="text-gray-700 group-hover:text-gray-600 transition-colors"
                                width="24" height="24"></iconify-icon>
                        </div>

                        <p class="leading-relaxed text-gray-300 mb-8" data-translate="testimonials.quote3">"I was skeptical about AI screening at first, but
                            it cut out months of wasted interview time. Having a built-in global payroll system to
                            compliantly pay our new remote hires is just the cherry on top."</p>

                        <div class="flex items-center gap-4 mt-auto border-t border-white/5 pt-6">
                            <img src="https://hoirqrkdgbmvpwutwuwj.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/assets/assets/0a04490f-27f4-44a6-b75a-f64e08d7caf2_320w.jpg"
                                alt="Olivia Parker"
                                class="group-hover:ring-white/5 transition-all w-10 h-10 object-cover border-white/10 border rounded-full ring-transparent ring-2"
                                data-translate-alt="testimonials.oliviaParker">
                            <div class="">
                                <div class="text-sm font-normal text-white tracking-tight font-manrope" data-translate="testimonials.oliviaParker">Olivia Parker
                                </div>
                                <div class="text-xs font-medium text-[#CBF300] font-manrope" data-translate="testimonials.cooGlobalReach">COO, GlobalReach App</div>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </Section>
